{"type":"drakon","name":"03-живые-хосты","params":"Этап 3. Силуэт: обнаружить и классифицировать хосты в разрешённых CIDR.","parent":"reglament f5000","items":{"1":{"type":"end"},"2":{"type":"branch","branchId":1,"one":"61","content":"Контекст и живые IP"},"3":{"type":"action","one":"68","content":"T1595 · №4227 · Nmap\nnmap -sn -n $SUBNETS\n-oA hosts_ping","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[4227],"inputs":["approved_cidrs"],"outputs":["hosts_ping.xml"]}},"4":{"type":"action","one":"5","content":"Объединить IP Nmap и fping\nв live-ips.txt; удалить повторы","workflow":{"handler":"merge-live-hosts","inputs":["hosts_ping.xml","live-hosts.txt"],"outputs":["live-ips.txt"]}},"5":{"type":"question","one":"6","two":"7","flag1":1,"content":"Есть живые IP\nв разрешённых CIDR?","workflow":{"handler":"preflight","decision":"live_ips_present","inputs":["live-ips.txt"],"outputs":[]}},"6":{"type":"action","one":"10","content":"Зафиксировать live-ips.txt\nи перейти к классификации"},"7":{"type":"action","one":"50","content":"empty: живых IP нет;\nсохранить coverage и артефакты"},"10":{"type":"branch","branchId":2,"one":"11","content":"Windows и SMB"},"11":{"type":"action","one":"12","content":"T1595 · №4229 · Windows\nnmap -Pn -n -sV -p135,139,445,3389\n$LIVE_IPS -oA windows","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[4229],"inputs":["live-ips.txt"],"outputs":["windows.xml"]}},"12":{"type":"action","one":"69","content":"T1595 · №3265 · NXC SMB\nnxc smb $SUBNET --timeout 5\n> nxc-smb.txt","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[3265],"inputs":["approved_cidrs"],"outputs":["nxc-smb.txt"]}},"13":{"type":"action","one":"14","content":"Windows: SMB/RPC/RDP/WinRM.\nСохранить ОС, имя, домен,\nSMB signing и роль Windows","workflow":{"handler":"classify","inputs":["windows.xml","nxc-smb.txt"],"outputs":["windows_candidates"]}},"14":{"type":"question","one":"15","two":"16","flag1":1,"content":"Доказательств достаточно\nдля Windows Workstation?","workflow":{"handler":"classify","decision":"windows_workstation_confirmed","inputs":["windows_candidates"],"outputs":[]}},"15":{"type":"action","one":"20","content":"Сохранить факт Windows/SMB\nи доказательство"},"16":{"type":"action","one":"20","content":"Сохранить coverage Windows/SMB"},"20":{"type":"branch","branchId":3,"one":"21","content":"Контроллеры домена"},"21":{"type":"action","one":"22","content":"№4230 · Kerberos и LDAP\nnmap -Pn -n -p88,389,636\n--open $SUBNETS -oA dc","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[4230],"inputs":["approved_cidrs"],"outputs":["dc.xml","dc_candidates"]}},"22":{"type":"action","one":"23","content":"№3746 · SMB null session\nnxc smb $DC_IP -u \"\" -p \"\"\n> dc-smb.txt","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[3746],"inputs":["dc_candidates"],"outputs":["dc-smb.txt"]}},"23":{"type":"action","one":"70","content":"DC: Kerberos + LDAP + DNS/SMB.\nСохранить домен и кандидаты DC"},"24":{"type":"action","one":"30","content":"Сохранить факт DC и\nдоказательство"},"30":{"type":"branch","branchId":4,"one":"31","content":"Linux, принтеры, камеры и NAS"},"31":{"type":"action","one":"32","content":"Linux · T1595\nnmap -Pn -n -sV -p22 --open\n$LIVE_IPS -oA linux-ssh","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[4229],"inputs":["live-ips.txt"],"outputs":["linux-ssh.xml"]}},"32":{"type":"action","one":"33","content":"Принтер · №3992/3994\nnmap -Pn -n -p631,9100 --open\n$LIVE_IPS -oA printers","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[3992,3994],"inputs":["live-ips.txt"],"outputs":["printers.xml"]}},"33":{"type":"action","one":"71","content":"Камера/веб/NAS · №3275\nnmap -Pn -n -sV -p80,443,554,2049,3260\n$LIVE_IPS -oA devices","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[3275],"inputs":["device_candidates"],"outputs":["devices.xml"]}},"34":{"type":"question","one":"35","two":"36","flag1":1,"content":"Доказательств достаточно\nдля фиксации роли устройства?","workflow":{"handler":"classify","decision":"device_role_confirmed","inputs":["linux-ssh.xml","printers.xml","devices.xml"],"outputs":["device_roles"]}},"35":{"type":"action","one":"40","content":"Классифицировать: Linux,\nпринтер, камера, NAS, сеть"},"36":{"type":"action","one":"40","content":"Сохранить coverage устройств"},"40":{"type":"branch","branchId":5,"one":"41","content":"Классификация и API"},"41":{"type":"action","one":"72","content":"Свести роли: DC, Windows, Linux,\nпринтер, камера, NAS, сеть, unknown","workflow":{"handler":"classify","inputs":["windows_candidates","device_roles","dc_candidates"],"outputs":["host_roles"]}},"50":{"type":"branch","branchId":6,"one":"51","content":"Фиксация этапа 03"},"51":{"type":"action","one":"52","content":"Передать facts, coverage\nи evidence через API","workflow":{"handler":"publish-coverage","inputs":["scan_artifacts"],"outputs":["api_coverage","api_evidence"]}},"52":{"type":"insertion","one":"60","content":"↗ 04-нет-учётных-данных","teleport":"reglament p04","teleportPending":null},"60":{"type":"branch","branchId":7,"one":"1","content":"Exit"},"61":{"type":"question","one":"3","two":"63","flag1":1,"content":"VPN-ready и разрешённые\nCIDR подтверждены?","workflow":{"handler":"preflight","decision":"vpn_ready_and_cidrs_confirmed","inputs":["vpn_ready","approved_cidrs"],"outputs":["task_context"]}},"63":{"type":"action","one":"50","content":"Ошибка: нет разрешённых CIDR"},"64":{"type":"question","one":"24","two":"30","flag1":1,"content":"Контроллер домена\nподтверждён?","workflow":{"handler":"classify","decision":"domain_controller_confirmed","inputs":["dc.xml","dc-smb.txt"],"outputs":[]}},"65":{"type":"question","one":"67","two":"50","flag1":1,"content":"Есть классифицированные\nхосты?","workflow":{"handler":"classify","decision":"classified_hosts_present","inputs":["host_roles"],"outputs":[]}},"67":{"type":"action","one":"50","content":"Сохранить hosts, порты, роли, coverage и доказательства","workflow":{"handler":"publish-facts","inputs":["host_roles"],"outputs":["api_facts"]}},"68":{"type":"action","one":"4","content":"T1595 · №3735 · fping\nfping -a -g $SUBNET\n> live-hosts.txt","workflow":{"handler":"mitre-command","commandIds":[3735],"inputs":["approved_cidrs"],"outputs":["live-hosts.txt"]}},"69":{"type":"question","one":"13","content":"Есть признак Windows в Nmap OS или NXC/SMB,\nлибо NetBIOS и домен/SMB signing одновременно?","workflow":{"handler":"classify-windows","decision":"windows_signs_present","inputs":["windows.xml","nxc-smb.txt"],"outputs":[],"rules":["Nmap OS содержит Windows","NXC SMB сообщает Windows","NetBIOS вместе с доменом или SMB signing"]},"two":"16","flag1":1},"70":{"type":"question","one":"64","content":"Есть минимум два признака контроллера домена,\nвключая LDAP/Active Directory: Kerberos, LDAP,\nдомен SMB/NXC или ответ DC?","workflow":{"handler":"classify-domain-controller","decision":"domain_controller_evidence_present","inputs":["dc.xml","dc-smb.txt"],"outputs":[],"rules":["не менее двух признаков","один признак обязан быть LDAP 389/636 либо Active Directory","Kerberos 88","домен SMB/NXC либо ответ DC"]},"two":"30","flag1":1},"71":{"type":"question","one":"34","content":"Есть признаки типа устройства по портам,\nbanner или SNMP?","workflow":{"handler":"classify-device","decision":"device_signs_present","inputs":["linux-ssh.xml","printers.xml","devices.xml"],"outputs":[],"rules":["Linux: SSH+Unix banner","Принтер: 515/631/9100 или SNMP","Камера: RTSP/ONVIF/web banner","NAS: SMB/NFS/iSCSI+banner производителя"]},"two":"36","flag1":1},"72":{"type":"action","one":"65","content":"Свести итоговую роль:\nприоритет: DC → Windows → Linux → NAS → принтер → камера.\nСохранить роль, признаки, уверенность и ссылку\nна исходный артефакт для каждого IP.","workflow":{"handler":"assemble-host-roles","inputs":["windows_candidates","dc_candidates","device_roles"],"outputs":["host_roles"],"rules":["приоритет ролей: DC, Windows, Linux, NAS, принтер, камера","сохранять роль, признаки, уверенность, артефакт"]}}},"keywords":{"function":true,"machine":false,"async":false,"export":false,"algoprop":false,"lazy":false},"nextId":69}
